1. e4 c5 { In conclusion, the Sicilian Defense can lead to very aggressive variations and the games played with this defense are usually attacking and one mistake can make a difference! The Sicilian is my personal favorite after e4 because there are so many variations that can be played which lead to very even games between both sides. I hope you found this study useful :) } *


